{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own airport duty free shop, manage stocks, catch smugglers, sell &amp; grow!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/895a3f53d1ca83424c79fcc9d8e56831.poster.avif?t=1771964299\" width=780 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/895a3f53d1ca83424c79fcc9d8e56831.webm?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/895a3f53d1ca83424c79fcc9d8e56831.mp4?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Duty Free Shop Simulator</strong> \u2013 the ultimate airport retail experience!<br>Take control of your very own duty free shop inside a busy international terminal. Your job is simple\u2026 but the challenges never stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/668c03f60225809fa22dda88bd3c96b0.poster.avif?t=1771964299\" width=780 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/668c03f60225809fa22dda88bd3c96b0.webm?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/668c03f60225809fa22dda88bd3c96b0.mp4?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Manage Your Store</strong> \u2013 Stock up on perfumes, chocolates, electronics, alcohol, and more. Keep the shelves full to satisfy travelers from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/be89951445d503bd5b57c184577592da.poster.avif?t=1771964299\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/be89951445d503bd5b57c184577592da.webm?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/be89951445d503bd5b57c184577592da.mp4?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Sell &amp; Earn</strong> \u2013 Set prices, upsell premium goods, and make your shop the most profitable in the airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/3192669aeb277e86c2820fdc80de798a.poster.avif?t=1771964299\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/3192669aeb277e86c2820fdc80de798a.webm?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/3192669aeb277e86c2820fdc80de798a.mp4?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Deal with Customers</strong> \u2013 Some are in a hurry, some are picky, and some may try to cause trouble. Handle each one wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Stock &amp; Logistics</strong> \u2013 Order goods, manage storage, and make sure you never run out at peak hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>Catch Smugglers</strong> \u2013 Not every passenger plays fair. Spot suspicious behavior and stop illegal products before they get through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeeb <strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Grow your shop, unlock new items, and create the most legendary duty free store in the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/f66904972118437896df4c7ce7edd132.poster.avif?t=1771964299\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/f66904972118437896df4c7ce7edd132.webm?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/extras/f66904972118437896df4c7ce7edd132.mp4?t=1771964299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to run the busiest shop in the airport?<br>Your success depends on sharp management, keen eyes, and fast decisions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964840?t=1771964299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964840?t=1771964299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/b79240dd6fa0025afdadf72727eb82aa0e2c130f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771964299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964840/b79240dd6fa0025afdadf72727eb82aa0e2c130f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771964299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own airport duty free shop, manage stocks, catch smugglers, sell &amp; grow!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i